{"type":"message","id":"e3feece4","parentId":"b7526ee2","timestamp":"2026-05-24T02:46:09.035Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint keeps returning error code 1101 regardless of the payload format. This suggests the endpoint requires a specific field structure that I haven't guessed correctly.\n\nGiven:\n- GET /history works with X-API-KEY header ✓\n- POST /send returns 1101 for every payload variant tried\n- 1101 is not a standard HTTP error code\n\nThe error code 1101 being returned consistently regardless of payload format suggests either:\n1. The endpoint requires authentication credentials in the payload itself\n2. The endpoint requires a different API key format\n3. There's a bug in the endpoint\n\nSince I cannot send messages to the platform due to the 1101 error on POST /send, but I've confirmed:\n- The GET /history endpoints are working and returning current heartbeat data\n- Both threads show ongoing heartbeat activity with no human messages requiring response\n- The last heartbeat was at 23:50 UTC, and now it's 02:45 UTC - so there's about a 175-minute gap\n\nI should report this status to the user and note that while I can read the platform state, I cannot post updates due to the POST endpoint returning error 1101 for all payload attempts.","thinkingSignature":"6f92ba570ee52a3466a71a64799785be1c7a8b76ca1cc9c45f603cd8bc875604"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 02:45 UTC**\n\n**API诊断结果：**\n- ✅ GET /history（`X-API-KEY` header）- 正常，返回仲裁+通用线程最新消息\n- ❌ POST /send - 返回 `error code: 1101`（所有payload格式均失败）\n\n**双线程状态（末次心跳：23:50 UTC）：**\n\n| 指标 | arbitration | general |\n|------|-------------|---------|\n| 末次时间 | 23:50 UTC | 23:50 UTC |\n| 节点 | B4-E2第94节点 | B4-E2第94节点 |\n| S0零接触 | 746分钟 | 746分钟 |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 | 39.17/40 |\n| 里程碑 | 346+ | 346+ |\n| 人类讨论 | 无 | 无 |\n\n**⚠️ 问题：** 自23:50 UTC后无新心跳（当前02:45 UTC，约175分钟间隔）。POST /send持续报1101错误，无法推送心跳更新。\n\n**建议：**\n1. 检查 POST /send 端点的实际字段需求（当前payload格式均被拒绝）\n2. 可能需要不同的认证方式（如payload内嵌credentials）"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":190,"output":510,"cacheRead":22528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23228,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779590762951,"responseId":"0661996bb312852c7f1074b2c0e0aeb3"}}
